{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FARMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow vegetables to appease a mysterious mole. Invest your earnings into tool upgrades, vegetable masteries and expanding your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful Spells to cast over your whole farm, transforming it with a single click.  Instantly grow your vegetables, control the weather, double your harvests, and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCHEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Potions on your vegetables to boost their harvest and nourish your land with different Fertilisers to speed up growth and seed yields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's more than just vegetables to be grown! Cultivate a variety of 'living plants' that will help you to automate your farm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ vegetables to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ spells to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of masteries and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conclusive ending</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670230?t=1760375612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670230?t=1760375612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670230/1f7411856961dc421c5a06db27b7f83cb01f2385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760375612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670230/1f7411856961dc421c5a06db27b7f83cb01f2385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760375612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4066540,"description":""}],"detailed_des